00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:56.640
the lands and waterways

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:58.020
of what's now the state of Connecticut.

00:00:58.020 --> 00:01:00.720
And we honor and respect
the enduring relationship

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:03.445
