outstanding paleontologist,

00:01:15.456 --> 00:01:17.430
and a man who I think it's fair to say

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:21.600
profoundly transformed
our view of dinosaurs.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.360
And it gives me great
pleasure to introduce

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:26.970
