00:01:26.970 --> 00:01:28.140
faculty member in the Department

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:29.520
of Earth and Planetary Sciences,

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:31.470
and a curator of vertebrate paleontology

00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:33.435
and vertebrate zoology
at the Peabody Museum

00:01:33.435 --> 00:01:36.720
to introduce this year's speaker.

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:37.952
Thank you.

00:01:37.952 --> 00:01:40.702
(audience claps)

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:45.203
- Well, welcome everyone again

00:01:45.203 --> 00:01:48.310
to the first John Ostrom lecture,

00:01:48.310 --> 00:01:52.320
which I hope is a first
